From b9ed56423f01d7481a982b923812951fdb6cd061 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: clean-room <clean-room@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 16:40:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/17] feat(windows): deliver system toast notifications with
 WinRT

Upstream stubs show_desktop_notification on Windows, so system toast
notifications are dropped for native and remote Windows clients.

Build ToastGeneric content through the WinRT XML DOM and submit it with
ToastNotificationManager under the per-user herdr app ID. This keeps
notification text as data and removes the uv, Python, windows-toasts,
helper-process, network, and elevation requirements.

Add focused DOM tests plus an ignored real-notification smoke test, and
serialize the existing PATH-sensitive Windows shell test with the shared
environment lock.
